- User confirmed the runner-hosted GitHub MCP and Git MCP connect over SSH: GitHub MCP discovered 91 tools; Git MCP discovered 14 tools. The subsequent Gemini model request failed while converting a GitHub MCP function schema: nested `parameters.properties[].items.properties[].type` contained an array, which Gemini's Schema protobuf rejects ("Proto field is not repeating, cannot start list").
